message: >-
  If you use the Stage 02C-1 synthetic implementation or its frozen negative
  pilot results, cite this version of the software archive.
title: "SAFER-MedAI: Frozen Synthetic Typed-Evidence Pilot (Stage 02C-1)"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Jahanian
    given-names: Mojtaba
