keywords:
  - risk auditing
  - synthetic simulation
  - evidence acquisition
  - negative results
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Python standard-library implementation and frozen records for a prospective
  synthetic five-world test of evidence-compatible risk auditing and typed
  evidence acquisition, including a negative primary result against a repair-first
  Neyman baseline. Not a clinical risk certification system.
